```json
{
  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# 02 - Image Preprocessing\n",
        "\n",
        "Notebook thực hiện tiền xử lý ảnh ISIC trước khi đưa vào Faster R-CNN và U-Net.\n",
        "\n",
        "Các bước:\n",
        "- Resize ảnh\n",
        "- Normalize ảnh\n",
        "- Chuyển Ground Truth Mask thành Binary Mask\n",
        "- Kiểm tra kích thước và giá trị pixel\n",
        "- Hiển thị kết quả trước và sau preprocessing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "from pathlib import Path\n",
        "\n",
        "import numpy as np\n",
        "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
        "from PIL import Image\n",
        "import torch\n",
        "from torchvision.transforms import functional as TF\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 1. Configuration"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "IMAGE_DIR = Path(\"../../data/images/train\")\n",
        "MASK_DIR = Path(\"../../data/masks/train\")\n",
        "\n",
        "OUTPUT_IMAGE_DIR = Path(\"../../data/processed/images\")\n",
        "OUTPUT_MASK_DIR = Path(\"../../data/processed/masks\")\n",
        "\n",
        "OUTPUT_IMAGE_DIR.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n",
        "OUTPUT_MASK_DIR.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n",
        "\n",
        "IMAGE_SIZE = (256, 256)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Image directory:\", IMAGE_DIR)\n",
        "print(\"Mask directory :\", MASK_DIR)\n",
        "print(\"Target size    :\", IMAGE_SIZE)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 2. Load Sample"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "image_files = sorted([\n",
        "    file for file in IMAGE_DIR.iterdir()\n",
        "    if file.suffix.lower() in {\".jpg\", \".jpeg\", \".png\"}\n",
        "])\n",
        "\n",
        "if not image_files:\n",
        "    raise FileNotFoundError(\"Không tìm thấy ảnh trong dataset.\")\n",
        "\n",
        "image_path = image_files[0]\n",
        "mask_path = MASK_DIR / f\"{image_path.stem}.png\"\n",
        "\n",
        "image = Image.open(image_path).convert(\"RGB\")\n",
        "mask = Image.open(mask_path).convert(\"L\")\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Image:\", image_path.name)\n",
        "print(\"Original image size:\", image.size)\n",
        "print(\"Original mask size :\", mask.size)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 3. Resize Image and Mask\n",
        "\n",
        "Ảnh sử dụng Bilinear interpolation.\n",
        "\n",
        "Mask sử dụng Nearest Neighbor để không làm thay đổi nhãn pixel."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "resized_image = image.resize(\n",
        "    IMAGE_SIZE,\n",
        "    Image.Resampling.BILINEAR\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "resized_mask = mask.resize(\n",
        "    IMAGE_SIZE,\n",
        "    Image.Resampling.NEAREST\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Resized image size:\", resized_image.size)\n",
        "print(\"Resized mask size :\", resized_mask.size)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 4. Normalize Image\n",
        "\n",
        "Pixel được đưa về khoảng [0, 1].\n",
        "\n",
        "Sau đó có thể chuẩn hóa theo Mean và Standard Deviation nếu cần cho model."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "image_tensor = TF.to_tensor(resized_image)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Tensor shape:\", image_tensor.shape)\n",
        "print(\"Min value   :\", image_tensor.min().item())\n",
        "print(\"Max value   :\", image_tensor.max().item())"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 5. Binary Ground Truth Mask\n",
        "\n",
        "Pixel có giá trị > 0 được xem là lesion.\n",
        "\n",
        "- 0 → Background\n",
        "- 1 → Lesion"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "mask_array = np.array(resized_mask)\n",
        "\n",
        "binary_mask = (mask_array > 0).astype(np.uint8)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Mask shape:\", binary_mask.shape)\n",
        "print(\"Unique values:\", np.unique(binary_mask))\n",
        "print(\"Lesion pixels:\", np.sum(binary_mask == 1))\n",
        "print(\"Background pixels:\", np.sum(binary_mask == 0))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 6. Visualize Before / After"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "fig, axes = plt.subplots(2, 2, figsize=(10, 8))\n",
        "\n",
        "axes[0, 0].imshow(image)\n",
        "axes[0, 0].set_title(\"Original Image\")\n",
        "axes[0, 0].axis(\"off\")\n",
        "\n",
        "axes[0, 1].imshow(mask, cmap=\"gray\")\n",
        "axes[0, 1].set_title(\"Original Mask\")\n",
        "axes[0, 1].axis(\"off\")\n",
        "\n",
        "axes[1, 0].imshow(resized_image)\n",
        "axes[1, 0].set_title(\"Resized Image\")\n",
        "axes[1, 0].axis(\"off\")\n",
        "\n",
        "axes[1, 1].imshow(binary_mask, cmap=\"gray\")\n",
        "axes[1, 1].set_title(\"Binary Mask\")\n",
        "axes[1, 1].axis(\"off\")\n",
        "\n",
        "plt.tight_layout()\n",
        "plt.show()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 7. Save Processed Data"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "processed_image_path = OUTPUT_IMAGE_DIR / image_path.name\n",
        "processed_mask_path = OUTPUT_MASK_DIR / f\"{image_path.stem}.png\"\n",
        "\n",
        "resized_image.save(processed_image_path)\n",
        "\n",
        "binary_mask_image = Image.fromarray(\n",
        "    binary_mask * 255\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "binary_mask_image.save(processed_mask_path)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Saved image:\", processed_image_path)\n",
        "print(\"Saved mask :\", processed_mask_path)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 8. Preprocessing Summary"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "print(\"=\" * 50)\n",
        "print(\"PREPROCESSING SUMMARY\")\n",
        "print(\"=\" * 50)\n",
        "print(f\"Original size : {image.size}\")\n",
        "print(f\"Target size   : {IMAGE_SIZE}\")\n",
        "print(\"Image range   : [0, 1]\")\n",
        "print(\"Mask values   : {0, 1}\")\n",
        "print(\"Resize image  : Bilinear\")\n",
        "print(\"Resize mask   : Nearest Neighbor\")\n",
        "print(\"=\" * 50)"
      ]
    }
  ],
